{"4060250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Bet", "steam_appid": 4060250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Bet</strong> brings players to the dusty towns of the Wild West with a <strong>first-person action and poker experience</strong>.<br>Join duels in the town square, show your cards at the poker table, and survive against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Realistic Duels</strong>: Fast-paced FPS combat that tests your reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️ <strong>Poker Tables</strong>: Texas Hold’em style games combining strategy and luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤠 <strong>Wild West Atmosphere</strong>: Horses, towns, saloons, and cowboy culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Multiplayer Competition</strong>: Play online with friends or players around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>Weapon &amp; Character Customization</strong>: Create your own unique style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Open World Elements</strong>: Explore the town, join new duels, and discover the atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on both your gun and your cards to survive.<br><strong>Win… or be run out of town!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Bet</strong> brings players to the dusty towns of the Wild West with a <strong>first-person action and poker experience</strong>.<br>Join duels in the town square, show your cards at the poker table, and survive against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Realistic Duels</strong>: Fast-paced FPS combat that tests your reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️ <strong>Poker Tables</str